OL,3,GNEWSAFish swim upstream for first time
OL,4,Ain 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnvironment Agency project manager
OL,7,FIneke Jackson said the area was home to
OL,8,Fotters, amphibians and birds but it
OL,9,Fneeded "improvements to help protect
OL,10,Fthe beck and for wildlife to flourish".
